        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuúng bar múk hatlá' sakwasleemút, kuúng tam heemahe, kuúng gár ta tlank i káhh. Qoomár kuúng bar múk hatlá' sakwasleemút, a kuúng tin kilók sakwasleemút. Asma kuúng muruú ta tlehhit a kuduú kilá' ta sakwasleemut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a kata', «Atén a xuaán, sakwasleemár Mungú dír múk tlehhmi'iiká tlehhiita a sakwasleemár ganaa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulqumooeé', kuúng múk tlehhmi'iiká' gi tlehhahhiít un sakwasleemút. Ala kuúnguú kilá' baré tlehhmi'iiká' in tlehhaahhít. Kuúng ka xu', sakwasleemár Mungú awa góba'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laqaá kuúng hhooeemaá Mungú kudá' yaariir nee qiqtliingós nee daamaaraangós, in waqaaqá'a? A xu'ukáhe adór hhooeemaá Mungú kuúng ur uuruxuná' as tawa hhu'u'uun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng muunaáwók kwisíng gawide nee oo hhu'uu'úngw sla'aakahe xarasleemaá Mungú in gawaawók i tlahhmís ay bál sakwasleemár Mungú, baldá' sakwasleemár Mungú ar ganaa' bar kinga geehhooeés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma baalaadae Mungú umuúqo heewo gu buu' ar hariímár tlehhmi'iiwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudá' xirif nee ilaiwa/ame nee hhitiru'uuma wasle nga leelehhiitiye' ar qiqtliingw baraá tlehhma'aá hhoe, Mungú gi slafíngw alhhe'eesay wáslí haniis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala awa hatlá' a múk qahuuse nee kudá' looeema ngaa si'iye' as muruú tlákw nguwa eeharahariya', Mungú buhhtaawós nee xarasleemaawós ga ku'uus gawaá múk adoorí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero oo tlakweemaá tlehhaahhiít, gusisiingw nee slahh'amaayeero ngi slayá'. Múk giiriím oo Yahudi, ala tam múk Yunani sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' sleémeero hhooeemaá tlehhahhiít, Mungú inooín gin xirfuú i haniis, nee ilaiwa/ame nee wayda. Múk giiriím oo Yahudi, ala tam múk Yunani sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú i barqaantusiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdá' sleémeero hara'ayár Mose ga xuaaká, ala tlakweema kay tleéhh, inooín ki sakwasleemuut, tam hara'aya ka xuiikahe. Mukdá' hara'ayár Mose ga xuú', ala tlakweema kiri tleéhh, inooín ki sakwasleemuut ar hara'ayaadá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk ta gan'amuú i harafaari nee Mungú, a ooanaaká an kudá' hara'aya gaa axaas, ala múk ta gan'amuú i harafaari, an kudá' adoodá' hara'aya i kat ga tlehhiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma tam xoordaá hatlá', kudá' hara'ayár Mose ngi kooma'aaká, inooín baraá tlehhmi'ii'ine gár ta tleehhi a tidá' hara'ayár Mose i kat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slafingw'ín ga laqaaqán adór muruudá' hara'aya i kat kura baraá muner'íní gooín. Asma tam muner'ín nee inslaway'ín adoorí ngi laqaaqaná'. Asma inslaway'ín oo kilá' inooín gin sakwasleemuut, laqaá gin aleekal/án. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' tleehharuut bál Mungú bar lu/aaroó baraá munér muu gu sakwasleemuut ar baraá Yesu Kristo. Gaarí an adoodá' Ya/abtór hho' i kat, tidá' aníng ni alki/iit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy kuúng a adoomá? Kuúng a daara/aán asma tawa heé Yahudi. Kuúng gár ta i tliintí' a hara'ayár Mose. Nee slám kuúng an daara/aán tawa kat, «Aníng a heé Mungú.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng taa intsaahhatimís hara'ayár Mosewo. Gawaá adoorihe gár Mungú i slai aga tsáhh, nee muruú tlákw nee oo hhoe tsaahharo u aleesleér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng ti kilók xú', adór tar geeraharusmoó taampu, nee gwa/aateemaá múk baraá giwtír i dirií', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geeraharusmoó múk gár xuaaká, nee intsaahhatusmoó na/aá ninakw, asma kuúng xu'uti sleémeero nee looeemaawo i koón baraá hara'ayár Mosewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúnguudá' múk hatlá' intsaahhatimisuú wa slaá', ahaá kuúng mis ti kilók intsaahhatimisaká? Kuúnguudá' múk hatlá' i dahareemiís tawa kat, «Gár hee ma fiisaar,» ahaá ala kuúnguú kilá' mas fisisiín? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúnguudá' káh, «Ma fuquusaar,» ala kuúnguú kilá' baré a fuqús? Kuúnguudá' munguaá hatlá' waaqaqaá', ahaá ala kuúnguú kilá' mas fisisiín baraá maray'ín wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúnguudá' hara'ayár Mose gar waahhamiím, ahaá ala kuúnguú kilá' mas Munguú waaqaaqá' ar hara'ayaadá' kawa eeharahatká? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Gooi i kat, «Umuú Mungú ku waaqaaqaa' nee múk xoordaá hatlá' as kuungá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng barnaxes hara'ayár Mose aga iialooés, daqaní al/utloorók i gaa bú'. Ala kuúng barnaxes hara'ayár Mose aga sí', daqaní al/utloorók i gaa bu'uká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé xoorór hatlá' oo taa al/utliiká, inós barnaxes hara'aya gaa eehár, kwí ku harafaáriíke tawa adór heé taa al/uútl, inós tam kwaa al/utliikahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuúng heé Yahudi tu sakwasleemuut nee múk xoordaá hatlá'. Asma kuúng hara'aya tam a koonda baraá gooiro, nee kuúng tam taa al/utli, ala kuúng hara'aya a eeharahatká. Ala inooín hara'aya ka iialooeemiis, inooín tam kaa al/utliniikahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma hee barnaxes a heé Yahudi baraá muruú tlehhma'aá slaqwa kilós, inós a heé Yahudír kil'eeká. Slám al/utlór taa tleéhh gawaá slaqwa, a al/utlór kil'eeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala heé Yahudi oo kilá', an kudá' Yahudi'iimarós baraá muunií dirii'. Nee al/utlór kilá' a tidár muuná kuwa al/utli. Al/utloorí kan tleehh nee Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú, slám ka tleehhiiká nee hara'aya. Heé adoorí xirfuuwós amór i dahhi a amór mukooká, ala a amór Mungú.",
